    <h1>How to use CDP?</h1>
    <p>
      Caponeu Digital Platform (CDP) is a tool for cooperation between Caponeu project consortium team members and disemination of materials. In order to use CDP you need to have a working Internet connection and access to appropriate software. All content can be accesses by using either free and open source software or by system tools available on all computer operating systems.
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>For access to web pages and all embedded content - modern internet browser like Google Chrome, Microsoft Edge, Safari, Firefox etc.</li>
      <li>To open PDF documents - default operating system PDF reader or Adobe Acrobat Reader DC or Google Drive</li>
      <li>To open DOC, DOCX, XLS, XLSX documents - Libre office, One Drive, Goolge Drive</li>
    </ul>

    <p>All content is available as defined in <a href="/terms">Terms and conditions</a>.</p>

